Corresponding source
--------------------
The complete corresponding source of every release is this repository (branch
android-preview) at the commit named in that release's notes, plus the dependency
archive named below, which the scripts in tools/android-preview/ download, verify by
sha256 and use. It is available from the repository's release page and issue tracker
without a request; if you received only the APK, ask there.

